              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani egogoŋioto Ŋisirael, apotu toreikis Ŋikanaani akitiya ŋiticisyo aŋuna kec, nai nyiritara ikes Ŋikanaani anakwap a ŋin.",
          "type": "text",
