        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋiamori kiretakis ŋituŋa a ekabila a Dan kiboyoto anakwap a ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, nyecamakis ikes etiyaun nadipoe a ŋikamukumukui. ",
          "type": "text",
