          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torubakis Ŋiamori iboiyete alo Areres, alo Aijalon ka alo Saalibim, nai apotu ŋiletok a Yosepu kisicana ikes nooi, toreikis ikes akitiya ŋiticisyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.35",
